# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages — the equivalent of server.js's
# `app.get(/.*/)` catch-all. Without it, a hard refresh on /gallery or a deep
# link into /draw returns Pages' own 404 instead of the app.
#
# Status 200 (rewrite), not 301/302: the URL must stay as the user typed it so
# vue-router resolves the right route once index.html boots.
#
# Existing static files win over this rule, so /assets/*, /sw.js and
# /.well-known/* are still served as themselves.
/*  /index.html  200
